        "summary":  "Despite two-thirds of organizations deploying AI agents in production, only 29% of agents interact with each other, according to a Leah and IDC report. Companies plan to double their agentic AI budgets over the next year, yet lack proper governance and cross-functional coordination. Enterprises must transition from isolated agent deployments to coordinated, governed agent portfolios.",
